{"sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","items":[{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k001","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"포유류의 배외 조직은 배아 생존과 물질교환에 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k002","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"양막은 양수를 둘러싸며 융모막은 태반 형성에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k003","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"난황낭은 인간 초기 조혈과 발생 과정에 기여하고 요막 관련 조직은 제대·혈관 발달과 관계가 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k004","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"태반의 모체 혈액과 태아 혈액은 일반적으로 직접 섞이지 않지만 물질 교환이 일어난다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k005","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"산소와 영양소는 태아에게 전달되고 노폐물은 모체 방향으로 이동할 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k006","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"태아 순환에서 제대정맥은 태반에서 태아로 산소가 상대적으로 풍부한 혈액을 운반하며 제대동맥은 태아에서 태반으로 혈액을 보낸다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k007","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"정맥관, 난원공, 동맥관은 태아기의 우회 경로를 제공한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k008","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"출생 후 폐 환기와 압력 변화로 이 경로들의 기능적 폐쇄가 진행된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k009","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"조직 이식·유전자 기능상실·기능획득·구제 실험은 발생 신호가 필요조건인지 충분조건인지 평가하는 데 활용된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k010","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"제대정맥은 태반→태아, 제대동맥은 태아→태반.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k011","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"난원공은 심방 사이 우회 통로다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--extraembryonic-k012","sectionId":"development/extraembryonic","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"필요조건과 충분조건을 구별하여 발생 실험을 해석한다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"developme